# Tezzeret, Cruel Captain: "Whenever an artifact you control enters, put a loyalty counter on Tezzeret" - your artifacts only.
# Cast with three Moxen (the Moxen entered before him), he starts at 4; his own Mox Sapphire and an Ornithopter (an artifact
# creature) each add one (6); Bot2's Mox Pearl on turn 2 and Bot1's own Lightning Bolt (not an artifact) on turn 3 add none.
# His -3 then searches for an artifact with mana value 1 or less: Mind Stone (2) is refused beside Sol Ring (1), the one
# taken, and Tezzeret is at 3. 

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Tezzeret, Cruel Captain
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island
Mind Stone
Sol Ring
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Island x15

